sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant S3 as Object store
    participant Q as Queue
    participant C as Consumer

    P->>S3: 1. Put payload under a key you generated
    S3-->>P: 2. Object is durable
    P->>Q: 3. Send claim check, key only
    Q->>C: 4. Deliver small message
    C->>S3: 5. Get object from the configured bucket
    S3-->>C: 6. Payload
    Note over S3: Lifecycle expires the object<br/>after queue plus DLQ retention
